# Gadget IMAGE tag used by cond.sh's warm-up and by run_one.sh's trace_tcp / snapshot_socket clients.
# The IG server (DaemonSet gadget/gadget, kubectl-gadget) stays v0.54.1 (versions.lock, IG_TAG in cond.sh).
# test-cluster ran "trace_tcp:latest" and "snapshot_socket:latest" (thesis capture scripts). In
# September 2026 :latest was built with ig v0.55.1: every thesis captureA/ig_tcp.err says "This gadget
# was built with ig v0.55.1 and it's being run with v0.54.1". So the benchmark runs the v0.55.1
# images on the v0.54.1 server, as the thesis did. Digests on ghcr.io, checked 2026-10-02:
#   trace_tcp:v0.55.1        sha256:5808d2dd41f872a405ebf5b4ccb005974162b9f1444e4191f2df8cbce9abeef3
#   snapshot_socket:v0.55.1  sha256:182a010b22191520a4cb8b7a877e8a8b990a380651bb8a83810dc4ee4b69abb2
# run_one.sh records the digest the gadget pods report (ig_*.err / versions.json) for each run.
GADGET_TAG=v0.55.1
